# generated outputs
# Scoped deliberately. An unanchored "results*/" or "legacy*/" also matches
# benchmarking/results_* (the committed benchmark outputs the docs cite) and
# old_code/beta_2026/legacy/ (source code), so both are anchored to the repo
# root where the README's example commands actually write.
/results/
/legacy/
/both/
examples/data/
examples/out_*/
benchmarking/out*/
*.tsv.gz

# development process record -- archived locally, never published
.superpowers/
docs/superpowers/
/STAGE*_STOP_REPORT.md
